(text "U402 receives GPS TX/PPS on main3V3; U404 drives GPS RX on GPS3V3. Exact TI input VIH2.0V.\nR410/R411 set GPIO17 UART idle; GPIO17 may drive LOW briefly at power-up, so firmware renegotiates after boot.\nGPS-only fixture:1k bleed on main3V3, verify main rail<=0.2V before asserting off-domain behavior.\nVBACKUP/NRESET float per CDTop; crank reset can require a cold start. D401 indicates SEARCH.\nJ401/L406/D402 factory fitted in RVB21 candidate. Pin11 supplies antenna bias: no second bias source or DC block.\nUse active3.3V antenna with qualified4–25mA draw; RF/ESD/cable model still requires physical qualification.\nU401 is the sole owner-soldered module; omit its factory paste, then locally solder after factory assembly.\nFirmware115200baud/10Hz with checked PCD antenna reports; SBAS is not available at10Hz." (at 17.78 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aee0d585-6e78-5b2f-8dce-cea4d17b74d1"))
